<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 2 — Tue 6 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #parking #ferry #d2<br><br>D2. Leave the car here and walk on as a foot passenger. DON&#x27;T put it on the car ferry — you don&#x27;t need it in Bellagio and it costs several times a foot ticket.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cadenabbia+imbarcadero">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
