<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 3 — Wed 7 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #parking #free #10-15minwalk #d3<br><br>D3 free fallback. White lines on the road up to Perledo. 10-15 min down, 20-25 min back up.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Perledo+Lecco">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
