<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 4 — Thu 8 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #parking #free #noeffortview #d4<br><br>D4. 14th-c. hermitage with a restaurant and terrace, drivable. The panorama with zero walking if you&#x27;re short on time.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Eremo+di+Monte+Barro">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
