<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 4 — Thu 8 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #parking #free #parkandride #d4<br><br>D4. ~150 spaces, bus line 6. Second free option for Bergamo.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Via+San+Bernardino+149+Bergamo">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
