<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 7 — Sun 11 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #parking #free #d7<br><br>D7 and D8. Free parking at the pass, at the foot of the coffin gondola. 20 min from Selva.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Passo+Sella+parcheggio">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
