<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 2 — Tue 6 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #michelin #splurge #d2<br><br>The closest starred restaurant to your base. Contemporary, produce-driven. +39 039 5312410.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dac+a+Tra+Castello+di+Brianza">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
