<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 3 — Wed 7 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #dinner #romantic #booknow #d3<br><br>D3 dinner. Il Cavatappi is tiny, in a stone alley — the romantic one. Vecchia Varenna is on the water in a former black-marble works. Varenna after dark is the prettiest village on the lake.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Il+Cavatappi+Varenna">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
