<name>D5 · Nives — Selva village square</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 5 — Fri 9 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #openyearround #safebet #d5<br><br>CONFIRMED OPEN YEAR-ROUND, which in this valley in October is not a small thing. South Tyrolean + Mediterranean, homemade pasta. +39 0471 773329.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ristorante+Nives+Selva+di+Val+Gardena">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
