<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 6 — Sat 10 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #wine #indoor #rainplan #d6<br><br>Augustinian monastery with a rotunda library, baroque church AND its own winery doing tastings. Historic, indoors, wine — arguably a better rainy morning than the hike is a sunny one.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Abbazia+di+Novacella+Neustift">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>11.648,46.735,0</coordinates></Point>
