<Placemark>
<name>D6 · Cantina Tramin — Termeno</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 6 — Sat 10 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #wine #nobooking #closedSun #d6<br><br>One of Italy&#x27;s best co-ops in a striking modern building. Tastings in the wine shop WITHOUT booking, Sat 09:00-17:00, closed Sunday. An hour south — hard to combine with Val di Funes.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cantina+Tramin+Termeno">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
