<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 8 — Mon 12 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #booknow #closedWed #d8<br><br>D8 dinner, effectively on your doorstep. Agriturismo with its own dairy. Open until late October, CLOSED WEDNESDAYS. Book: +39 368 7008083.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=El+Brite+de+Larieto+Cortina">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
