<name>D10 · Baita Fraina — above Cortina</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 10 — Wed 14 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #dinner #d10 #d10<br><br>D10 dinner (El Brite is closed Wednesdays). Mountain-lodge regional cooking in small panelled rooms, Michelin Guide listed.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Baita+Fraina+Cortina">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
