<name>D10 · SanBrite — Michelin star, &#x27;agricucina&#x27;</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 10 — Wed 14 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #michelin #splurge #callfirst #d10<br><br>Everything from the family farm, own cheese dairy. Tasting EUR90-120. Sister to El Brite, 10 min from Passo Tre Croci. CALL +39 0436 863882 to confirm October opening.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SanBrite+Cortina+d%27Ampezzo">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
