<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 11 — Thu 15 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #roadaccessible #longseason #d11<br><br>11th-century hospice turned restaurant, road-accessible, tends to have a longer season than the mountain huts. A good long-lunch answer on a wet day.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Rifugio+Ospitale+Cortina">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
