<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 12 — Fri 16 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #spritz #canalside #d12<br><br>D12 evening. Everyone sits on the canal edge and on the moored boat. Daily 11:00-01:00.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Al+Timon+Venezia">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
