<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 12 — Fri 16 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #cicchetti #closedSun #go11am #d12<br><br>D13, 11:00. Standing-room counter, no written menu, everything made that morning. EUR1.50-4 each. NO RESERVATIONS, CLOSED SUNDAY, and the shutters come down ~14:00 when the trays are empty.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=All%27Arco+Venezia+San+Polo">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
