<Placemark>
<name>D12 · Antiche Carampane — the big dinner</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 12 — Fri 16 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #booknow #closedSunMon #d12<br><br>D12, 20:30. The one with the sign saying no pizza, no lasagne, no tourist menu. Outstanding fried fish. ~EUR70-90pp. BOOK WEEKS AHEAD. Closed Sun-Mon, so Friday works.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Antiche+Carampane+Venezia">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>12.33,45.4383,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>D12 · Osteria alla Vedova — Cannaregio</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 12 — Fri 16 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #cicchetti #thepolpetta #d12<br><br>D12 evening. The legendary deep-fried polpetta. EUR2-5 a cicchetto. Closed Thursday (fine for you). Carry cash.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Osteria+alla+Vedova+Venezia">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>12.3339,45.4426,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>D12 · Vino Vero — Fondamenta Misericordia</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 12 — Fri 16 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #naturalwine #daily #d12<br><br>D12 evening. Natural wine bar, crostini with stracciatella, anchovy, lardo. Open daily 12:00-24:00.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Vino+Vero+Venezia">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>12.327,45.445,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>D14 · Cantina Zeni wine museum — Bardolino</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 14 — Sun 18 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #wine #free #nobooking #d14<br><br>D14. Free museum and enoteca, no booking needed — the one drop-in option on the lake.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Museo+del+Vino+Zeni+Bardolino">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>10.718,45.557,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>D14 · Guerrieri Rizzardi — Bardolino</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 14 — Sun 18 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #wine #openSunday #booknow #d14<br><br>D14, 15:00. Aristocratic estate, tastings DAILY 10:00-18:30 — one of the very few open on a Sunday. From ~EUR15 for 90 min. Book: visite@guerrieri-rizzardi.it.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Guerrieri+Rizzardi+Bardolino">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>10.72,45.553,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>D14 · Valeggio sul Mincio — &#x27;nodo d&#x27;amore&#x27; tortellini</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 14 — Sun 18 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #food #lunch #ontheme #d14<br><br>D14 lunch, 15 min from Peschiera. Home of tortellini di Valeggio, the love-knot, with its own legend about a nymph and a knight. About as on-theme as a honeymoon lunch gets.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Valeggio+sul+Mincio">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>10.735,45.352,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>D15 · Franciacorta — Ca&#x27; del Bosco / Bellavista, Erbusco</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 15 — Mon 19 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #wine #onroute #lastlunch #d15<br><br>D15, ~13:00. Italy&#x27;s best metodo classico, ~40 min along the A4 towards MXP. Turns dead driving time into the last good thing you do. WHOEVER DRIVES DOESN&#x27;T TASTE.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ca+del+Bosco+Erbusco+Franciacorta">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>9.977,45.572,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>D15 · Zenato — Peschiera del Garda</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 15 — Mon 19 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #wine #booknow #MonSat #d15<br><br>D15, 10:00. Lugana AND Valpolicella/Amarone under one roof — the best single tasting on the lake. Classic tour EUR40 (4 wines + food, 90 min). MON-SAT ONLY, booking essential.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Zenato+Peschiera+del+Garda">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
<styleUrl>#s_food</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>10.705,45.446,0</coordinates></Point>
