</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>D8 · Passo Pordoi — 2,239 m</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 8 — Mon 12 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #pass #2239m #d8 #d8<br><br>D8, ~12:45. Sass Pordoi cable car above it almost certainly closed by mid-October — bonus, not a plan.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Passo+Pordoi">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
