<Placemark>
<name>D8 · Passo Sella — 2,244 m</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 8 — Mon 12 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #pass #2244m #d7 #d8 #d8<br><br>Crossed twice: D7 for the coffin gondola, D8 on the Great Dolomites Road. Sassolungo fills the windscreen the whole way up. 20 min from Selva. Free parking.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Passo+Sella">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
