<name>D8 · Valley fallback — Val Pusteria via Dobbiaco</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 8 — Mon 12 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #badweather #fallbackroute #2h20 #d8<br><br>D8 SNOW FALLBACK. Ponte Gardena - A22 - Val Pusteria - Dobbiaco - SS51. 145 km, ~2h20 — actually FASTER on the clock than the passes, just far less beautiful. Check venetostrade.it and the Bolzano traffic portal that morning.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dobbiaco+Toblach">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
