<Placemark>
<name>D11 · Passo Giau — 2,236 m</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Day 11 — Thu 15 Oct</b><br><b>Tags:</b> #pass #2236m #returnloop #larches #d11<br><br>D11 return leg. Come home over Giau on the SP638 instead of retracing Falzarego — same time, makes the day a loop. Bare amphitheatre under Ra Gusela and Nuvolau; larches rivalling Lago Federa. Rifugio Fedare at the top is OPEN YEAR-ROUND.<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Passo+Giau">▶ Open exact location in Google Maps</a>]]></description>
